    kind: work_item  # 9d5c
    title: "swift: three construction shapes miss the init -- a generic T<X>(...) emits no edge at all, Outer.Inner(...) is unresolved, and an inherited init lands on the subclass"  # 9d5c
    status: todo_hard  # 9d5c
    priority: 3  # 9d5c
